<title>SOUTH KOREA: Samsung Electro-Mechanics net edges up.</title>
<headline>Samsung Electro-Mechanics net edges up.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	 (billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net				   35.4  vs    35.2</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>	common  shares (in cash)    12    vs     5</p>
<p>			   (in stock)   none  vs     2</p>
<p>	preferred shares (in cash)  13    vs     6</p>
<p>			     (in stock) none  vs     2</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		 41.2  vs    42.2</p>
<p>    Turnover			 1,489.5  vs 1,343.7</p>
<p>    Divident payment		   March 25</p>
<p>NOTE - Samsung Electro-Mechanics Co Ltd, a unit of the Samsung Group, is a major electronic parts producer and supplies mostly to other Samsung Group affiliates.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
